{
  "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5",
  "key": "7.5",
  "title": "অসীম গুণোত্তর ধারার সমষ্টি (Sum of Infinite Geometric Series)",
  "chapter": 7,
  "ordinal": 5,
  "passages": [
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p001",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$a + ar + ar^2 + ar^3 + \\dots$ গুণোত্তর ধারাটির প্রথম পদ $a$ এবং সাধারণ অনুপাত $r$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "a + ar + ar^2 + ar^3 + \\dots",
        "a",
        "r"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 143,
      "pdfPageEnd": 143,
      "printedPageStart": 138,
      "printedPageEnd": 138,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p002",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "সুতরাং, ধারাটির $n$ তম পদ $= ar^{n-1}$, যেখানে $n \\in N$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "n",
        "= ar^{n-1}",
        "n \\in N"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "এবার, $r \\neq 1$ হলে ধারাটির $n$ তম আংশিক সমষ্টি",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "r \\neq 1",
        "n"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p004",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$S_n = a + ar + ar^2 + ar^3 + \\dots + ar^{n-1}$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "S_n = a + ar + ar^2 + ar^3 + \\dots + ar^{n-1}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p005",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$S_n = a \\cdot \\frac{r^n - 1}{r - 1} \\quad যখন  r > 1  এবং  S_n = a \\cdot \\frac{1 - r^n}{1 - r}, \\quad যখন  r < 1$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "S_n = a \\cdot \\frac{r^n - 1}{r - 1} \\quad যখন  r > 1  এবং  S_n = a \\cdot \\frac{1 - r^n}{1 - r}, \\quad যখন  r < 1"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "latin-junk",
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**লক্ষ্য করি:**",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [],
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ক) $|r| < 1$ হলে, অর্থাৎ, $-1 < r < 1$ হলে, $n$ এর মান বৃদ্ধি করলে ($n \\to \\infty$ হলে) $|r^n|$ এর মান হ্রাস পায় এবং $n$ এর মান যথেষ্ট বড়ো করলে $|r^n|$ এর মান ০ এর কাছাকাছি হয়। অর্থাৎ $|r^n|$ এর প্রান্তীয় মান (Limiting value) ০ হয়।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "|r| < 1",
        "-1 < r < 1",
        "n",
        "n \\to \\infty",
        "|r^n|",
        "n",
        "|r^n|",
        "|r^n|"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ফলে $S_n$ এর প্রান্তীয় মান $S_n = \\frac{a(1 - r^n)}{1 - r} = \\frac{a}{1 - r} - \\frac{ar^n}{1 - r} = \\frac{a}{1 - r}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "S_n",
        "S_n = \\frac{a(1 - r^n)}{1 - r} = \\frac{a}{1 - r} - \\frac{ar^n}{1 - r} = \\frac{a}{1 - r}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p009",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "এক্ষেত্রে, অসীম ধারাটির সমষ্টি $S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p010",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "খ) $|r| > 1$ হলে, অর্থাৎ $r > 1$ অথবা $r < -1$ হলে, $n$ এর মান বৃদ্ধি করলে $|r^n|$ এর মান বৃদ্ধি পায় এবং $n$ কে যথেষ্ট বড়ো করে $|r^n|$ এর মান যথেষ্ট বড়ো করা যায়। সুতরাং এমন কোন নির্দিষ্ট সংখ্যা $S$ পাওয়া যায় না, যাকে $S_n$ এর প্রান্তীয় মান ধরা যায়।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "|r| > 1",
        "r > 1",
        "r < -1",
        "n",
        "|r^n|",
        "n",
        "|r^n|",
        "S",
        "S_n"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p011",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "অর্থাৎ, এক্ষেত্রে অসীম ধারাটির কোনো সমষ্টি নেই।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
      "pdfPageEnd": 144,
      "printedPageStart": 139,
      "printedPageEnd": 139,
      "reviewReasons": [],
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c07-t7.5-p012",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "গ) $r = -1$ হলে, $S_n$ এর প্রান্তীয় মান পাওয়া যায় না। কেননা, $n$ জোড় সংখ্যা হলে $(-1)^n = 1$ এবং $n$ বিজোড় সংখ্যা হলে $(-1)^n = -1$। এক্ষেত্রে ধারাটি হবে, $a - a + a - a + a - a + \\dots$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "r = -1",
        "S_n",
        "n",
        "(-1)^n = 1",
        "n",
        "(-1)^n = -1",
        "a - a + a - a + a - a + \\dots"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 144,
